    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Purchased as a bride by the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.phgt6OMwTAoAaKfR]{Lasombra} Don Guzman, who instead Embraced her after feeding on her cruel parents, Consuela Martinez was bred by her sire specifically to counter @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} diplomacy on the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat}'s behalf. Assigned nearly three years ago to break down talks between the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} and the Quincunx, she leads the pack Killing Spree in San Francisco, though she finds herself relying more on the subtler Misery Lords than her own bloodthirsty followers.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Martinez is regal, stern, and utterly calculating &mdash; every word and action serves a strategy. Guzman has promised her the Bishopric of San Francisco if she can turn the Camarilla and the Quincunx against one another before her six-month deadline expires.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Sergio Guzman. Subordinate ally: Scarlet Carson O'Toole (The Misery Lords). Disciplines (as printed): Auspex 1, Celerity 3, Dominate 4, Fortitude 3, Obtenebration 5, Potence 5.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
